{"title":"Career roadmap · Story Analyst","role":"Story Analyst","summary":"A Story Analyst evaluates screenplays, scripts, story concepts, books, pitches, and other narrative material for story quality, structure, character development, originality, audience potential, genre fit, and commercial or creative suitability.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career alignment"},{"type":"p","text":"A Story Analyst evaluates screenplays, scripts, story concepts, books, pitches, and other narrative material for story quality, structure, character development, originality, audience potential, genre fit, and commercial or creative suitability."},{"type":"p","text":"This career is particularly relevant to students combining Creative Writing, Film Studies, and Screenwriting. The role exists across film/TV studios, production houses, streaming platforms, literary agencies, publishers, development companies, and entertainment consulting."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Story Craft","Screenwriting","Film Language","Script Analysis","Industry Awareness","Research","Audience Understanding"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Script Reading Intern, Story Intern"},{"text":"Reading and evaluating scripts"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"Story Analyst, Script Reader"},{"text":"Coverage and story assessment"}],[{"text":"Developing"},{"text":"Senior Story Analyst, Script Development Associate"},{"text":"Development recommendations"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"Story Editor, Development Executive"},{"text":"Shaping projects and scripts"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Creative Development Manager, Story Consultant"},{"text":"Managing development pipelines"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Head of Development, 